# Tuebor Project Rules

## What This Repo Is
Evidence-based accountability documentation covering Michigan courts, prosecutors, judges, and oversight systems. Part of the primals.eco cross-protection network. Every claim must be sourced to court records, public filings, or published reporting.

## Critical Constraints
- NEVER fabricate sources or speculate beyond what documents say
- NEVER publish personal information about private citizens, minors, or protected parties
- NEVER publish phone numbers, home addresses, or children's names of any investigation participant
- Rita Williams' relationship to site operators is PRIVATE — public contact is hello@clutchjustice.com only
- Tone is factual and precise — let documents speak, not commentary

## Content Format
- All pages use Zola TOML front matter (`+++` blocks)
- Every page needs: title, description, weight (sort order)
- Actor pages need: Identity table, key findings with sources, Investigation Path checklist, Sources section
- Evidence pages need: sourced claims, "What Is Proven vs What Is Not" section for forensic evidence
- Investigation guides need: actionable steps, templates, Michigan statutory citations (MCL, MCR)

## Sourcing Standard
- Court records: case number, court, date, docket entry
- Public filings: LARA entity, campaign finance filing, ARIN WHOIS result
- Published reporting: outlet, author, date, URL
- Statutes: MCL or MCR citation
- Unsourced items go in Investigation Path as `- [ ]` checklist items, NOT as findings

## File Organization
- Actors: `site/content/actors/lastname.md`
- Evidence: `site/content/evidence/descriptive-name.md`
- Analysis: `site/content/analysis/descriptive-name.md`
- Investigation guides: `site/content/investigate/guide-name.md`
- Timeline: `site/content/timeline/_index.md` (single master chronology)

## Key Databases
- LARA: mibusinessregistry.lara.state.mi.us/search/business
- Michigan Courts: courts.michigan.gov/case-search and courts.michigan.gov/opinions
- PACER: pacer.uscourts.gov
- ARIN: whois.arin.net
- Campaign finance: transparencyusa.org and miboecfr.nictusa.com/cfr
- AGC: agcmi.org | JTC: jtc.courts.mi.gov

